<title>UK: KFW adds $50 million to five-year bond.</title>
<headline>KFW adds $50 million to five-year bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-04-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond has been increased to $200 million from $150 million, lead manager Morgan Stanley said.</p>
<p> BORROWER   KFW INTERNATIONAL FINANCE</p>
<p>GUARANTOR  KREDITANSTALT FUER WIEDERAUFBAU</p>
<p> AMT   *200 MLN	 COUPON     7.0	 MATURITY    23.APR.02</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE**100.975   PAY DATE    23.APR.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.875     REOFFER  **99.35     SPREAD	 =</p>
<p> NOTES     *ORIGINALLY LAUNCHED FOR $150 MLN ON 19.MAR.97</p>
<p>	    **NEW ISSUE AND REOFFER PRICE.</p>
<p> MOODY	AAA	 LISTING    LUX	 PAY FREQ    ANNUAL</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  AAA	 DENOMS (K) 1-10	SALE LIMITS US/UK/DE</p>
<p> NEG PLG    NO	  CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   IPMA 2</p>
<p> GOV LAW    NEW YORK  HOME CTRY  =	   TAX PROVS   STANDARD</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.25	SELL CONC  1.625     PRAECIPUUM  =</p>
<p>UNDERLYING GOVT BOND CALL AT PAR 23.APR.99</p>
<p> NOTES	ISSUED OFF AN EMTN PROGRAMME</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
